"expression must have integral type"
When working with lookup tables, ensure that the index you are providing is an integer.

"Program will not fit into available Memory"
Remember 
Check "View > Memory Allocation"
Edit .cmd file, find the offending line, and put it in a ram where it will fit.

'Program too slow'
Wobble a GPIO pin to represent runtime and look at the output on an oscilloscope

'Program not getting past memcpy' 
Don't touch compiler options you don't know. When in doubt go to a version you know works and copy that over.